<title>USA: Burlington Northern grain railcar summary.</title>
<headline>Burlington Northern grain railcar summary.</headline>
<text>
<p>BNSF GRAIN FLEET SCORE CARD</p>
<p>APRIL 13 - MAY 04, 1997</p>
<p>BNSF WILL MAKE AVAILABLE, ON A PERIODIC BASIS, DESCRIPTIVE INFORMATION</p>
